+// -*- mode: rust; -*-
+//
+// This file is part of curve25519-dalek (shlosilo vendor patch).
+//
+// Device perf-bench entry points (feature `perf-bench`).
+//
+// shlosilo perf session: measures raw primitive costs on the target device so
